  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Each triangle starts at the wide top edge and tapers to a point. A "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dc2tog-bunting"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "dc2tog"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " decrease at each end of every row narrows the triangle over ten rows. A "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "pennant-edge"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "pennant edge"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " round neatens the sides before the triangle hangs from the cord."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use four DK colours and make three triangles per colour for an even repeat. Total yarn around 120 m across all four colours."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "suppliesCard",
        "attrs": {
          "heading": "Materials",
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "DK yarn, 4 colours",
              "qty": "30 m each"
            },
            {
              "name": "4 mm crochet hook",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Tapestry needle",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Scissors",
              "qty": "1 pair"
            },
            {
              "name": "3 m twisted cotton cord",
              "qty": "1"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Triangle (make 12)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chain 25. Row 1: dc across (24 sts). Row 2: ch 1, "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dc2tog-bunting"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "dc2tog"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", dc to last 2, dc2tog (22 sts). Repeat row 2 every row until 2 sts remain. Dc2tog. Fasten off. Work "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "pennant-edge"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "pennant edge"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " around side edges."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Assembly"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fold the top edge of each triangle over the cord and sl st or whipstitch into place. Space triangles 20 cm apart. Tie cord ends to loops for hanging."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
